 data-layer="proof"> &middot; the result, projection path and political reaction</span></li><li id="src-16" value="16"><a href="/records/the-hill-fed-decision-2026-09-16/">The Hill decision report</a> · The Hill, 2026-09-16 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the result and projection-dot counts</span></li><li id="src-17" value="17"><a href="/records/pbs-ap-fed-consumer-effects-2026-09-16/">Associated Press consumer-effects report</a> · PBS NewsHour, 2026-09-16 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the decision&#39;s reported effects on borrowers and savers</span></li><li id="src-18" value="18"><a href="/records/the-hill-trump-fed-reaction-2026-09-16/">The Hill on Trump&#39;s reaction</a> · The Hill, 2026-09-16 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the immediate political response</span></li><li id="src-19" value="19"><a href="/records/cnbc-warsh-followup-2026-09-18/">CNBC follow-up on Warsh&#39;s framing</a> · CNBC, 2026-09-18 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the post-decision interpretation of Warsh&#39;s words</span></li><li id="src-24" value="24"><a href="/records/ap-reconstruction-2026-09-17/">Associated Press next-day reconstruction</a> · Associated Press, 2026-09-17 <span class="src-usage" data-layer="proof"> &middot; the lag risk and next-day Treasury-yield movement</span></li></ol><p class="sources-line"><a href="/methodology">How we check</a> <span data-layer="proof"> &middot; where this page says <em>computed</em>, the arithmetic was done from the saved data series; where it says <em>record</em> or <em>checked</em>, the words trace to a saved document</span>.</p></section><section data-layer="fact"><h2>Since the previous story</h2><p><a href="/events/fed-rate/2026-07-29-three-dissents-for-a-hike/">Read the previous story</a></p></section><section class="revision-timeline" data-layer="fact" data-revision-confirmations="0" data-revision-changes="0"></section><section data-layer="proof"><h2>S