checks/audits/fed-rate--2026-09-16-unanimous-quarter-point-hike-2026-09-19-since-b75257dd-entailment.log:109:   139	        <p data-layer="narrative">The median projected federal funds rate for the end of 2026 rose from {projections.june2026Median} percent in June to {projections.september2026Median} percent in September. For 2027, the median rose from 3.6 percent in June to {projections.september2027Median} percent in September.<Cite s="fomc-sep-2026-09-16" passage="Federal funds rate         4.1    4.1" /><Cite s="fomc-sep-2026-09-16" passage="June projection          3.8    3.6" /></p>
