checks/audits/fed-rate--2026-09-16-unanimous-quarter-point-hike-2026-09-19-since-b75257dd-entailment.log:2978:-        <p data-layer="narrative">The distribution shows several paths around the median: {projections.oneMoreIncrease} of {projections.participantCount} officials projected a single hike, {projections.twoMoreIncreases} projected two hikes, and {projections.noMoreIncrease} predicted a pair of holds. Warsh did not submit a projection of his own.<Cite s="the-hill-fed-decision-2026-09-16" passage="Twelve of 18 FOMC officials projected a single rate hike" /><Cite s="the-hill-fed-decision-2026-09-16" passage="Four officials projected two hikes, while two predicted a pair of holds" /><Cite s="fomc-press-conference-2026-09-16" passage="I have not offered a projection of" /></p>
