   173	          <p>The 10-year Treasury yield slipped the next day, a move the Associated Press tied to easing inflation worries. That yield strongly influences mortgage rates, while the Fed controls a short-term rate.<Cite s="ap-reconstruction-2026-09-17" passage="10-year Treasury yield even slipped a bit, a likely sign of reduced inflation worries" /><Cite s="ap-reconstruction-2026-09-17" passage="The 10-year Treasury, for instance, strongly influences mortgage rates" /></p>
